# Dantooine, the Khoonda Plains and Khoonda (TSL, 003EBO, 601DAN, 602DAN):
# the galaxy map to Dantooine, Bao-Dur on the Exile's lightsaber, ashore
# with Bao-Dur and Kreia (DSimpson: Bao-Dur for the sensors); Dillan's
# greeting, the battered droid (no Awareness, Computer or Repair to see it
# is broken: asked through), the landing pad's containers (one locked,
# Bao-Dur's Security; the "{Blast}" cylinder is left shut, see below), into
# Khoonda: Suulru's vaporator (helped), Administrator Adare (the Ebon Hawk
# owned, the Force's guidance, Vrook to be found first: the sublevel's
# permission), Berun, Zherron (a hand offered: the kinrath job), and out to
# Saedhe by the cave (the atmospheric sensors asked after: DSimpson takes
# his quest, not Berun's evidence). Starts from Telos's last checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_done data/routes/tsl/dantooine_khoonda.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Dantooine - Khoonda" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the pazaak Ithorian (a game of chance), the Rodian's crystals.
use Galaxymap
travel 0             # Dantooine (planetary.2da)
talk                 # Bao-Dur's lightsaber talk as the Hawk lands
party 1,6            # Bao-Dur and Kreia
to tr_leave          # the ramp: the party screen, accepted
module 601dan
talk                 # Dillan's greeting off the ship
use olddroid         # the battered protocol droid, asked through
talk
use MilLowPlstcCylin@2 # the landing pad's cylinders
use MilLowPlstcCylin@3
use MilLowPlstcCylin@4
use CivilFootLker    # the Ithorian's footlocker (DSimpson: "goodies")
leader 1             # the locked cylinder by Khoonda's wall (DC 18):
unlock MilHighPlstcCylin # Bao-Dur's Security
use MilHighPlstcCylin
leader player
# Left shut: the pad's "Plasteel Cylinder{Med, Blast}" (MilMidPlstcCylin),
# which no key opens (KeyRequired, no key) and DSimpson mines open: TSL's
# mine set on a container is not built (the sim's is a door's).
exit To_602          # Khoonda's front door
module 602dan
say I'll see what I can do. # Suulru: Jorran's missing modulator
use npc_suulru
talk
say I came in that ship, yes. # Administrator Adare
say I'd prefer if you keep that quiet
say The Force seems to have guided me here
say He didn't send for me, but I would like to meet with him
say I will make it my first priority. # the sublevel's permission
use npc_terena
talk
use npc_berun        # Berun, asked through (his doubts of Zherron)
talk
say Neither one.     # Zherron: a hand offered, the kinrath job taken
say I wanted to see if anyone needed a hand.
say What sort of work do you have?
say I'll see what I can do.
use npc_zherron
talk
# BLOCKER: back by Berun's desk. From Zherron's post the walk to the front
# door makes for a corner of the way 0.2 m from the foot of a nonwalk wall
# at (-6.7, -14.8) that the navigation mesh has no edge for (a vertical
# walkmesh face on the floor); the box meets its end on the next leg and
# the walk turns there for good.
to npc_berun
exit To_601
module 601dan
use MilLowPlstcCylin@1 # by the crashed speeder
say What are you doing out here? # Saedhe: the missing atmospheric sensors
say I'll see what I can do.
use npc_saedhe
talk
use MilLowPlstcCylin@5 # beside him
save dantooine_plains
